@startuml
title SD-UI03 — Checkout and fulfilment
caption To-Be draft | F03 · Frontend · Customer /checkout and /orders/:id · merchant /merchant/orders/:id
actor User
boundary "Route and Checkout, FeeReview and OrderTimeline" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
UI -> Client : orders, confirm-fee, fee and order actions
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
else fee revision changed or invalid handoff
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Show current quote or recovery action
end
@enduml
